2 CONT haRav haGaon Simon Wolf Auerbach bn David Tebele z”l Nov 1631 (Special note: Father is David Tebele “Feivels” Auerbach per Gal-Ed. David Tebele Auerbach Scheuer also had a son Simon, who also died in Nov 1631, but in Wien)
