2 CONT From http://pedhatzur.com/family-tree-sarah-kahana-shapira-2/37-rabbi-moshe-isserlis/
2 CONT
2 CONT (37) Rabbi Moshe Isserlis
2 CONT
2 CONT Also called Reb Moshe Deliers [דלייזרס]. He was a leader and leader of the Brisk community.
2 CONT
2 CONT He published a book of responsa of the Rema, in which it is written: "Incur R. Moshe to Rabbi Moshe Eliezer, brother of the author."
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1640.
