3 CONC ul the King. 
3 CONT It looks like the bride is Nessale Nissla Gisela Wahl Katzenellenbogen, daughter of Moshe Meir MAHARASH ABD Brisk, but according to all the site, her husband is Moshe Moses Hakohen Katz and not Natan (who's grand grandfather was Y
3 CONC osef Hacohen Katz. Anyway, the letter has nothing to do with Chana Flekeles Horowitz and therefore this chain is not for real.
