2 CONT
2 CONT The Nagid Saul having heard of the situation immediately went to Rabbi Zalman Shor and revealed the secret to him. He requested that he immediately marry his virgin daughter Hanale, although this was against the law. After that th
2 CONC e Heavens bestowed upon Hanale holy seed. My father further extolled her wisdom and saintliness, which he had heard from his holy forefathers in those lands since his mother was the pious rebbetzin Yente, the maternal granddaughte
