1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Shaul Katzenellenbogen had two sons named Moshe (Moses), not to be confused. This is the profile of one of them who was born to Shaul's first wife. He died young, without issue.  His half-brother from Shaul's secon
2 CONC d wife lived to adulthood and had children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source for this profile: The Unbroken Chain by Dr. Neil Rosenstein (1990) Volume 1, Chapter 11, page 25, G7.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Additional source for this profile: The Unbroken Chain by Dr. Neil Rosenstein, 3rd edition, Volume 1, Chapter 2, page 152, G7.1
