1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Conflicting evidence re his parents - Maharal's gd.son (son of Tilla sabatka) - or of Zechria Kloizner (HaNavi הנביא)? or are these 2 different persons?
2 CONT
2 CONT Both named Fishels after their father-in-law
2 CONT
2 CONT Both are referenced as married to Yute (Yehudith) daughter of Rabbi Fishel of Krakow
2 CONT
2 CONT décédé en 1671?
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Grandson of the Maharal of Prague
2 CONT
2 CONT Rabbi Aryeh LEIB  of Krakow married Yehudith (Jute) FISCHEL (b. about 1620). Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Rabbi Zecharia Mendel LOEB
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Debora LEIB (b. 1660) - m. Shaul Shoyel TEOMIM (d. 1707) (4 children).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Efraim III FISCHEL
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. daughter married Fishl LODMER
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Perl LEIB (b. 1666, d. 30 May 1722) married Rabbi Feivel Premsler Joshua Ezekial          TEOMIM (b. 1654, d. 1726)
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. daughter married Rabbi Samuel BethShmuel WAHL
2 CONT
2 CONT      6a. Elia COHEN.
2 CONT
2 CONT            6ab. Rivka GOLDE ?? married Rabbi Abraham LISSA
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.loebtree.com/theomim.html#frankel
2 CONT
2 CONT Rabbi Aryeh LEIB of Krakow
2 CONT
