1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.steinheim-institut.de/cgi-bin/epidat?id=ffb-2157&lang=de
2 CONT
2 CONT Her father was most probably Jacob = 20, VIII 1606 that died in Alsbach and is buried in Worms,
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob Gunzburg =4 IX 1636 HO 644 is almost certainly not the right one to be Gutlin’s father.  As you see on his Ele Toldot sheet, Ettlinger puts Gutle as doubtful. But if he had been able to lay out all of the actual children of 
2 CONC this Jacob and compare them, he would have seen that all of them are having babies in the 1630s, at a time when Gutlin, who died at a very old age =23 III 1655, was already a grandmother. Her son, Rabbi Meir Schiff, was born alrea
2 CONC dy in 1605.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob  5 VIII 1629 is not Gutlin Schiff's father,
2 CONT He had a daughter with this name already, Gutlin Romhild, and married just 1624.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob =um 1571 probably not Gutlin Schiff's father , he died C 84 years earlier than Gutlin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob = 6 Feb 1627 is probably not Gutlin Schiff's father  ,
2 CONT Gutlin's stone does not have HR"R, while he has + he has absolutely no particulars except for a little entry in the Beerdigungsbuch, which,would be astonishing if he were the father-in-law of someone as important as Jacob Schiff.
2 CONT
2 CONT Moses Jacob from Worms is not  Gutlin Schiff's father since he was levite,
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob = 20-II-1630 is not  Gutlin Schiff's father, since he married in 1604 and Gutlin was already married.
