2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT abd tykocin
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Possible errors:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. The identity of Isaac's mother is uncertain.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rosenstein & Weber [Rosenstein & Weber. The Edelman Hoax. AVOTAYNU Vol XIV, #2 Summer 1998] state that Margola Shor was his mother, while the Daniel Schwab Family Tree (ancestry.com) states that the daughter of Natan Neta Kahana (
2 CONC AB"D Ostraha & Premsla) and Rivka Shachna, was his mother. This tree arbitrarily lists Margola Shor.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. The identity of Isaac's wife as mother of Mordechai Heilprin is uncertain.
2 CONT
2 CONT While several sources are known, none is reliable:
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob Benjamin Weisburg states that Beila Segal was his wife. The Daniel Schwab Family Tree (Ancestry.com) states that Esther of Satanow, daughter of Leib of Premsla was his wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Naftali (Tali) Maimon (Geni.com), as well as the Hill / Chardell Family Tree (Ancestry.com), states that Esther of Stanov, daughter of Hirtz of Stanov, was his wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Moreover, the Jacob Heisler Family Tree (Ancestry.com) lists Esther as the mother of Mordechi (b. ca. 1625), while Beila is listed as the mother of Eliezer Lipman (b. 1630), Joel (b. ca. 1635) and David (b. ca. 1635).
2 CONT
2 CONT This tree arbitrarily follows the Jacob Heisler Family Tree.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://tablet.otzar.org/pages/?&restore=1&t=1626412999646&pagenum=69&book=151564
