1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Note: There is a potential confusion between https://www.geni.com/people/Margola-Frankel-HALPERN/6000000009255388524 and https://www.geni.com/people/Margela-Halperin/383919492090013483. Because both are married to 
2 CONC different Eliezer Halperins. The former is married to https://www.geni.com/people/%D7%94%D7%92%D7%90%D7%95%D7%9F-%D7%A8%D7%91%D7%99-%D7%90%D7%9C%D7%99%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8-%D7%9C%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%9E%D7%9F-%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%99
2 CONC %D7%9F-%D7%90%D7%91-%D7%93-%D7%95%D7%A8-%D7%9E-%D7%93%D7%A7-%D7%A7-%D7%98%D7%A8%D7%A0%D7%99%D7%92%D7%A8%D7%95%D7%93/4551130149520044656 and the latter to https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Eliezer-Ashkenazi-Halperin-A-B-D-Tiktin/34
2 CONC 8881984560013524. I do not know if https://www.geni.com/people/Margola-Frankel-HALPERN/6000000009255388524 is named Margola, and I have no idea why Frankel is added to the name. See: Jacobi: Volume 4, p 94, 14.2, p. 318, 15.1m, Vo
2 CONC lume 2. p. 4, 12.6, and Unbroken Chain: Volume 3, Chapter 6, p. 52 (G 5 and G 6.6) (25 OCT 2022)
