1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Note: A potential confusion exists between https://www.geni.com/people/Margola-Frankel-HALPERN/6000000009255388524 and https://www.geni.com/people/Margela-Halperin/383919492090013483. Because both are married to di
2 CONC fferent Eliezer Halperins. The former is married to https://www.geni.com/people/%D7%94%D7%92%D7%90%D7%95%D7%9F-%D7%A8%D7%91%D7%99-%D7%90%D7%9C%D7%99%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8-%D7%9C%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%9E%D7%9F-%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%99%D
2 CONC 7%9F-%D7%90%D7%91-%D7%93-%D7%95%D7%A8-%D7%9E-%D7%93%D7%A7-%D7%A7-%D7%98%D7%A8%D7%A0%D7%99%D7%92%D7%A8%D7%95%D7%93/4551130149520044656 and the latter to https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Eliezer-Ashkenazi-Halperin-A-B-D-Tiktin/3488
2 CONC 81984560013524.  
2 CONT
2 CONT I do not know if https://www.geni.com/people/Margola-Frankel-HALPERN/6000000009255388524 is named Margola. Meanwhile, as stated in the UC cited below, she was apparently not the spouse of https://www.geni.com/people/R-Judah-Leib-F
2 CONC rankel-of-Krotoschin/6000000009255441077?through=6000000009255388524, instead she had a sister who was the latter's spouse. See: Jacobi: Volume 4, p 94, 14.2, p. 318, 15.1m, Volume 2. p. 4, 12.6, and Unbroken Chain: Volume 3, Chap
2 CONC ter 6, p. 52 (G 5 and G 6.6) (25 OCT 2022)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT G5 R. Jacob Shor, ABD Lutsk, Brody and Brest-Litovsk, married Channah, daughter of R. Isaiah, son of Moses Reb Lazar's of Vilna, son of R. Eliezer (brother of R. Moses Isserles, the ReMA).
2 CONT
2 CONT G6.6 Daughter, married R. Eliezer Lipman Halpern, ABD Tarnogrod
2 CONT
2 CONT G6.7 '''Wife of Judah Lieb Frankel of Krotoschin, died in 1740 '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Source
2 CONT
2 CONT The Unbroken Chain - Neil Rosenstein (3rd Edition) Volume 3, Chapter 6, pages 52 (for G5 and G6.6) and 72 (for G5 and G6.7)
2 CONT
