1 NOTE {geni:about_me} PLEASE NOTE:  he could not have married, as his second wife, a daughter of R' Joshua Feiwel Teomim (c1654-c1733).  R' Joshua's eldest daughter, Beile, was b. c1685, and would have been only 5 years old at the time 
2 CONC of R' Issachar's death.  She was likely married to a member of his family, however -- perhaps an unidentified grandson.  See https://www.geni.com/people/Beile-Heschel-Teomim/6000000065544604828?through=6000000119037920856.
