1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Born and raised in Kanczuga, R. Aryeh Leib eventually became the Rabbi of the town. He was known as a saintly man and a great Torah scholar. The Pnei Yehoshua of Lvov testified that R. Aryeh Leib knew the Talmud be
2 CONC tter than anyone in his time. R. Aryeh Leib later took a pulpit in Zloczow and passed away there. His writings were collected and published by his grandchildren.
