1 NOTE {geni:about_me} About spouse and father:
2 CONT The book 'Gaon of Vilna and his Cousinhood' p. 19 asserts that he is the son-in-law of Eliahu Hassid (https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Eliyahu-The-Hassid-of-Vilna/6000000001539180262), who in turn is the son-in-law of Moshe 'Ber 
2 CONC HaGolah' (https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Moshe-Rivkah-s-auth-Be-er-HaGolah/6000000006798338132); no father for Eliyahu is given there.  At this moment he is being shown on Geni as the paternal grandson of Ber HaGolah, and no sp
2 CONC ouse is indicated. The book contradicts what is on Geni at this moment. Any comments on how to resolve this? (28JUN2026)
