1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kurt Alfred Georg Mendelsohn (Physics professor) is said to have been a great-great-grandson of Saul Mendelssohn, the younger brother of philosopher Moses Mendelssohn.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kurt_Mendelssohn
2 CONT
2 CONT However, starting from Kurt Alfred Georg Mendelsohn, my reading is that there was further generation in the line:
2 CONT
2 CONT Relationships: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Saul Mendelsohn great great great grandfather on my reading
2 CONT
2 CONT Meyer Mendel Mendelsohn west Prussia Nr 1598 son of Saul Mendelsohn and so great great grandfather of Kurt Alfred Georg Mendelsohn
2 CONT
2 CONT Leiser Mendelsohn son of Meyer Mendelsohn, grandson of Saul Mendelsohn and great grandfather of Kurt Alfred Georg Mendelsohn
2 CONT
2 CONT Philibert Philip Mendelsohn son of Leiser Mendelsohn so great grandson of Saul Mendelsohn and grandfather of Kurt Alfred Georg Mendelsohn
2 CONT
2 CONT Ernst Moritz Mendelsohn great great grandson of Saul Mendelsohn and father of Kurt Alfred Georg Mendelsohn
2 CONT
2 CONT Kurt Alfred Georg Mendelssohn: son of Ernst Moritz Mendelsohn and so great great great grandson of Saul Mendelsohn
