1 NAME Meir /Teomim/ Preacher in Lviv
2 GIVN Meir
2 SURN Teomim
2 NSFX Preacher in Lviv
2 _MARNM Teomim
2 NICK Meir b. Joseph Teomim
1 NAME //
2 GIVN
2 SURN תאומים
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1703
