1 NOTE {geni:about_me} R’ Aryeh Juda Leib Teomim-Pollak, aka “Juda Pollak”, “Lobl Pollak”, b. Lissa, 1731, d. in House No. 5, Holesov, 28 Oct 1796, age 65. He was a rabbi and religious leader in Holesov for many years, and resided in Hou
2 CONC se No. 5. He went by the surname “Pollak”, never Zwillinger. His wife was Tscharna, b. 1735, d. House No. 5, Holesov, 3 Aug 1807, age 72.
