1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * '''The whole family [formerly surnamed Fraenkel] took the surname name of Arnstein in 1813'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Two children emigrated to Australia: 
2 CONT - Edward went to London; then, convicted of theft, he "emigrated" in1832, and was pardoned. 
2 CONT - Adolf  went to Lippstadt 1813, married there in 1834,  then emigrated with his spouse and 5 children in1850. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * - Esther went to Vienna
