1 NAME Feisel /Fraenkel/
2 GIVN Feisel
2 SURN Fraenkel
2 _MARNM Arnstein
1 SEX M
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The family changed their name from Fraenkel to Arnstein around 1813.
2 CONT
2 CONT There is some tentative evidence that Feisel and his wife Auguste accompanied Feisel's brother Adolph, and his family, to Australia in 1850. They are listed on two associated shipping records as Ahrenstein, F & Auguste and/or Mr &
2 CONC  Mrs... the writing is very hard to read. I have then found a small entry in the newspaper indicating they may have returned to Hamburg in 1851. There is a reference to a Mr & Mrs Arnstein departing for Hamburg in 1851. It's diffi
2 CONC cult to qualify and I have not been able to find any other records relating to Feisel and Auguste Arnstein beyond that. - Dani Haski AJGS Sydney. June 2023.
