1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Need to find out who are Wolf Hirsch Neftelberger parents.  Wolf Hirsch Naftali married Gurtel in 1808.  That means Wolf Hirsch Neftelberger is missing parents in the tree.  Records from Germany show a Hirsch Nef
2 CONC telberger in 1837 parent to Semmerl and Naftali. There are some inconsistencies and need assistance from others who are researching this family line.
2 CONT
2 CONT * About the name a note in the "Stanton papers", [https://archive.org/details/charlesperrystanton_04_reel04/page/n886/mode/1up?view=theater real 06],  from Rüben Rosenfeld Fürth, den 27.0kt.l982
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/275364806/wolf-hirsch-neftelberger
2 CONT
2 CONT '''"The family name Arnstein, adopted by all of Ahron's sons, is a combination of 'Ahron' and the suffix '-stein,' which is popular in family names. Naftali's descendants use the suffix '-berger' to form Neftelberger."'''
