2 CONT cf. Basic Nikolsburg death data courtesy of Indexes to Mikulov births, marriages, and deaths online at the site of the Jewish Museum in Prague:
2 CONT
2 CONT Židovská náboženská obec Mikulov, Rejstrík (z roku 1913) k matrikám, NOZ 1762 - 1912, II. cást: zemrelí, Z 1762 - 1912 (1914), písmena A - I | Jewish Museum Collections http://collections.jewishmuseum.cz/index.php/Detail/Object/Sh
2 CONC ow/object_id/172906
2 CONT
2 CONT BENEDIKT Markus, "Landesrabbiner", d. 1829, age 74
2 CONT
2 CONT N.B. Though he was initially buried in Karlsbad, his remains were later removed to Nikolsburg for his ultimate resting place according to his wishes.
2 CONT
2 CONT cf. Burial details courtesy of:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.chewra.com/keshetnew/kweb/tomb_detail.aspx?tomb=12945&kid=0
2 CONT
2 CONT Lokalita:  	Mikulov   Kodové číslo:  	184-00193   Hrob číslo:  	0193   Hrob index:  	   Dat.úmrtí den:  	12   Dat.úmrtí měsíc:  	8   Dat.úmrtí rok od:  	1829   Dat.úmrtí rok do:  	0   Heb.název dne:  	Dalet   Heb.den:  	13   Jarca
2 CONC it:  	Av   Rok narození:  	0   Příjmení:  	Benet   Jméno:  	Mordechaj   Jméno otce: 	   Jméno manžela(-ky): 	   Pozn.lokalita: 	   Druh kamene: 	   Kameník: 	   Info povolání: 	   Symbolika: 	   Poznámka: 	CHRONO; Ejni ejni jorda 
2 CONC majim (gem 589) + Hitakic (595) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Further biographical details from various sources including the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT Biographisches Portal der Rabbiner
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.steinheim-institut.de:50580/cgi-bin/bhr?id=0122 
2 CONT
2 CONT BENET, Mordechai, bürgerlich Markus BENEDIKT BHR I.1, 175-177 ← 0122 →
2 CONT
2 CONT Geb. 1753 in Csurgó (Sürge) b. Székesfehérvár (Stuhlweißenburg) in Ungarn,
2 CONT
2 CONT Gest. 12. Aug. 1829 in Karlsbad, Westböhmen
2 CONT
2 CONT - Sein Vater Abraham Bia war Nachkomme des „Chacham-Zwi“, seine Mutter Fradel Benet Tochter mütterlicherseits des Frankfurter Rb. Naftali Kohn
2 CONT
2 CONT - vom Vater verwaist wächst er in bedrückten materiellen Verhältnissen auf, seine Mutter bringt ihn mit 5 J. in ihre Heimat Mikulov (Nikolsburg), wo er bei der Großmutter aufwächst ... ...
2 CONT
2 CONT - Nach dem Tode des Schwiegervaters 1784 ... 	
2 CONT - Asketische Persönlichkeit von imposanter Gestalt, sagte sich im 50. Lebensjahr von seiner Gattin los, um fortan ganz dem Studium leben zu können.
2 CONT
2 CONT etc. etc.
2 CONT
2 CONT Plus ...
2 CONT
2 CONT YIVO | Banet, Mordekhai ben Avraham
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.yivoencyclopedia.org/article.aspx/Banet_Mordekhai_ben_Avraham 
2 CONT
2 CONT Also cf. various historical newspaper articles about Markus Benedikt (N.B. generally the name under which he was known at the time):
2 CONT
2 CONT e.g.
2 CONT
2 CONT ANNO, Allgemeine Zeitung des Judenthums. Ein unpartheiisches Organ für alles jüdisches Interesse in Betreff von Politik, Religion ..., 1862-06-17, Seite 5
2 CONT
2 CONT http://anno.onb.ac.at/cgi-content/anno?aid=azj&datum=18620617&seite=5&zoom=33&query=%22Benedict%2Bnikolsburg%22~9&ref=anno-search 
2 CONT
2 CONT In which there are a few interesting details such as ...
2 CONT
2 CONT - Markus BENEDIKT's father is described as being a "Fleischhauer" - butcher - in Csurgó. (as likewise mentioned in YIVO)
2 CONT
2 CONT - his maternal grandmother is described as a "poor widow" at the time he is sent to Nikolsburg as a five-year-old.
2 CONT
2 CONT - A rather confusing - erroneous in dates? - mention of his engagement and subsequent marriage to the daughter of Gumpel PROSSNITZ: "Im Jahre 1781(?) wurde er von Markburg nach Nikolsburg berufen, wo er sich mit der einzigen 14 jä
2 CONC hrigen Tochter des Gumpel Prossnitz verlobte. ... 1773 vollzog er seine Verehelichung ..."
2 CONT
2 CONT ANNO, Die Neuzeit, 1901-02-08, Seite 4
2 CONT
2 CONT http://anno.onb.ac.at/cgi-content/anno?aid=neu&datum=19010208&seite=4&zoom=33&query=%22Benedict%2Bnikolsburg%22~9&ref=anno-search 
2 CONT
2 CONT In which it is written: "Väterlicherseits stammte er von R. Zebi Hirsch, Verfasser der Responsen "Chacham Zebi" und mütterlicherseits von R. Naftali Kohn, Rabbiner in Frankfurt a. M. ab."
2 CONT
2 CONT Both his mother Fradl and maternal grandmother Rebekka are described as being very "devout". His maternal grandfather R. Aberl Benet is described as being a highly regarded Talmudist.
2 CONT
2 CONT etc. etc.
2 CONT
2 CONT cf. also ...
2 CONT
2 CONT ANNO, Mährisches Tagblatt, 1885-08-04, Seite 6
2 CONT
2 CONT http://anno.onb.ac.at/cgi-content/anno?aid=mtb&datum=18850804&seite=6&zoom=33&query=%22Benedict%2Bnikolsburg%22~9&ref=anno-search 
2 CONT
2 CONT Not only a cute little story but providing a clue too to a grandson of this Markus BENEDIKT who bore exactly the same name and was an engraver in Belgrade:
2 CONT
2 CONT And also cf.
2 CONT
2 CONT Als hätten wir dazugehört: österreichisch-jüdische Lebensgeschichten aus der ... - Albert Lichtblau, Institut für Geschichte der Juden in Österreich - Google Books
2 CONT
2 CONT https://books.google.de/books?id=Ooa0uPgR-cEC&pg=PA311&lpg=PA311&dq=markus+benedikt+nikolsburg&source=bl&ots=eDLD1U7ibk&sig=ACfU3U1y7cmCEdgh3imtD1GH0UZ1hjwcjQ&hl=de&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwiZ5PrC-ongAhXLJ1AKHWKIDCUQ6AEwDnoECAUQAQ#v=onepag
2 CONC e&q=markus%20benedikt%20nikolsburg&f=false 
2 CONT
2 CONT Containing real-life recollections of the great rabbi by Siegfried ALTMANN's grandmother Mimi GROSSMANN which are not only entertaining but really reveal the incredible character of the man.
2 CONT
2 CONT (pip - Jan 2019)
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
