1 NAME Samuel /Margolis/
2 GIVN Samuel
2 SURN Margolis
2 _MARNM Margolis
2 NICK Szmoyl
2 NICK Shmuel
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1735
1 DEAT
2 DATE AFT 1784
1 TITL Rabbi
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} We know what became of his sons:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Mordechai Margolis was a rabbi, probably in Kalvarija.  Mordechai Margolis' eldest son, Judah Leib Margolis settled in Przerosl. His son, Eliahu (Eliasz) Margolis, was a rabbi all over Lithuania and NE Poland, as were Eliahu's s
2 CONC ons, grandsons, and great-grandsons.
2 CONT * Chaim Judah Leib's descendants took the name Levine. His son, Zvi Hirsh Harry Levine was the first Ashkenazi rabbi in Charleston/Abbeville and an early immigrant to America from Suwalki Gubernia.
2 CONT * Hirsh
2 CONT
2 CONT Reported DOB is 1725.  His maternal grandfather, Samuel Schick, died in 1715, so it makes sense that he would have been named after him, if the birthdate is approximately correct.
2 CONT
2 CONT He may have died before Sulka (Unknown or Margolis) Visanska named a son Szmojl Oszer.  If so, this might explain why we have the famous Asher Margolis later in the Margolis family, if Samuel Margolis' full given name was Shmuel A
2 CONC sher. [Actually this makes no sense because his brother was Asher. So if Sulka Wyzanska/Visanska named her son Szmojl Oszer, it could have been for both Shmuel and Asher.]
2 CONT
2 CONT As to the date of the birth of Szmoil Oszer Wizjanski, he married in 1842, so he was likely born in 1823.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.litvaksig.org/images/custom/GDL/All%20Suwalki%201784%20GDL.pdf Page 77, household 4 in Przerosl (Szmoyl, son of Mordechai).
2 CONT
2 CONT He is the head of a household of six people: Shmuel, his wife (not named), his sons Mordechai and Hirsh, and his daughters Shprintza and Kuna.  It appears that both he and his father were rabbis: '''מהורב שמואל בהרב מרדכי'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT * The Unbroken Chain by Dr. Neil Rosenstein, Vol 1 2nd edition, page 18. Paragraph G.10,2
2 CONT * The Margolis Family by Dr. Neil Rosenstein, 1984.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-40001-310579176/samuel-margolis-in-familysearch-family-tree FamilySearch Family Tree] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 18 2017, 4:10:30 UTC
2 CONC ''
