2 CONT * Ittel Margolis died age ninety one and was buried in Merkine (Meretz), married Eliezer Pruzhiner, ancestor of the Efrati Family, who died in 1846.  He was the son of R. Hanoch Heinich A.B.D. Kalwarija and Zabludow, near Bialysto
2 CONC k.
