2 CONT
2 CONT 1 R. (HaChaver) Yosef " HaKadosh" of  Ovan  No. 1 2 R. "HaAluf" Petachya  SOFER b. _____ Prague? d. 12 Jan 1599 Prague No. 2
2 CONT
2 CONT 3 R. Naftali Hirsh SOFER b. _____ Prague d. c1601 Prague   No. 3a m. Teltsa m. c1596
2 CONT      Teltsa:
2 CONT      "R' Moshe Rivkas" - Binyamin Rivlin 1971:
2 CONT      She was a descendant of Shaul Wahl, "King of Poland for a day" 4 R. Moshe RIVKAS b. 1596 d. 31 Jul 1671 Vilna Wrote "Be'er HaGola" No. 5 5 R. Petachya RIVKAS b. _____ d. after 1672 Vilna No. 9
2 CONT
2 CONT 6 Rachel RIVKAS  No. 17
2 CONT            m. Eliyahu Chasid d. 1710 Vilna
2 CONT               [son of Moshe KREMER and Leiba]
2 CONT  7 Zvi Hersh b. _____ Vilna d. 20 May 1765 Vilna  No. 25
2 CONT  8 Shlomo Zalman RIVLIS-RIVLIN  No. 33
2 CONT                       SY page 1: first to be called Rivlin
2 CONT                     m. Sara d. 8 Mar 1837 Shklov
2 CONT                   [daughter of Hillel]
2 CONT   9 Eliyahu "Platkes" RIVLIN b. _____ d. 18 Feb 1800 Shklov  No. 51                 Forefather of the Chabad Rivlins 10 Shlomo Zalman RIVLIN b. _____ d. 27 Jul 1847 Shklov No. 90
2 CONT                    m. Frumka NOTKIN
2 CONT                       [daughter of Natan Nota NOTKIN] 11 Efraim Fishel RIVLIN No. 167 12 Shmuel Natan Neta RIVLIN Rabbi of Krol  near Shklov  No292
2 CONT
2 CONT                         m. (Bat-Yakov) LIFSHITZ
2 CONT                            [daughter of Yakov LIFSHITZ and (Bat-Elchanan) KROL]
2 CONT
2 CONT 13 Shneur Zalman RIVLIN –  No. 538  m. Chava Rivka COHEN 14 Shmuel Nota RIVLIN – No. 939
