2 CONT
2 CONT According to Jacobi (p 173, 10.2, Vol2): her son claimed descent from: 1) the Heschel family, 2) the Heilprin family  3) from the https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-David-Segal-the-TaZ/4950928906290042156. This claim is not fully s
2 CONC atisfied by giving her https://www.geni.com/people/Moses-Heilprin-Parnas-of-Chelm/6000000001549430491 and  https://www.geni.com/people/Dobrish-Heilprin-Babad/6000000006712225347 as parents, because the TaZ is missing from the line
2 CONC age if using these parents. Instead, Jacobi proposes that her parents were: https://www.geni.com/people/R-Moses-Doberishes/6000000001703184496 (from the Heshel line) and https://www.geni.com/people/Deborish/6000000032170424280 (fr
2 CONC om the Heilprin and TaZ line), which would satisfy all three of the son's claims. This seems like a reasonable interpretation of the primary evidence. For those who want to check the facts presented by Jacobi: I believe he is refe
2 CONC rring to the Yichus Letter written by her son, https://www.geni.com/people/R-Abraham-Joshua-Heschel-Ohev-Israel/6000000001549489435, in the introduction to the book 'Geza Yishai' by Yekhutiel Silberman (Lvov 1856, reprinted Jerusa
2 CONC lem 1967). If someone can get hold of the relevant passage and post it here, we'd be grateful. (12 OCT 2022). 
