1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He is referenced in Neil Rosenstein's "The Unbroken Chain" as R' Haim Joseph Teomim of Svirz, son of R' Samuel Teomim, ABD of Lobsens and brother of R' Simcha Nathan Teomim.  His wife was Gitel bat Salomon, and the
2 CONC ir daughter (whose name is not provided) was married to her first cousin, Benjamin, son of R' Simcha Nathan Teomim.  
2 CONT
2 CONT He was R' Joachim [Chaim] [Haim] Joseph Teomim, b. in Lissa, c1760, d. in Svirz [now Svirzh] prior to 1814.  He and his wife Gitel were the parents of three known children:  Diene [the daughter referenced above], Samuel, and Israe
2 CONC l Leib.
