1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -------------------- Lived in Furth, a town in northern Bavaria - 7 km. from nuremberg - Germany. Furth - Fiorda was famous for its Yeshiva. In general, the Yeshivot in Germany were the forerunners of the Yeshivot 
2 CONC in Lithuania. The Chatam Sofer was prepared to leave his post as the head of the pressburg Yeshiva for becoming the head of the Yeshiva in Fiorda. Fiorda was famous for its printing and publishing  books.
