1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not to be confused with Zvi Hirsch Ish Horowitz, AB"D Chortkov. Pointed out by Chaim Freedman
2 CONT
2 CONT http://chfreedman.blogspot.com/2008/02/yoel-of-brisk.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Tsherkov (Bila or Belaya Tserkva) is south of Kiev, east of Berdichev, north of Uman.   Chortkov, Kisov, Kolomyja and Chernovitz are further South West.
2 CONT
2 CONT When part of the Michelson family moved three generations later as Meilichson to Ukraine and Bessarabia, they seemed to have family in the area. JewishGen lists a number of births in Kishinev (1873 to 1891) of children (Yehudit, S
2 CONC ara Hinda, Levi Yitzkhok, Itskhok Moyshe) of Yakov Meylekhzon (son of Yosef) and Basya Malka (daughter of Yakov) and it states "father from Berdichev". We have been unable to locate this family.
2 CONT
2 CONT Isaac Meilijson Engel, March22, 2011.
