2 CONT Student of Rabbi Yechiel Michel of Zlotchov known as the Maggid of Zlotchov. Yechiel Michel was the son of  Rabbi Yitzchak of Drohobitch, who was initially an opponent of Chasidisim, and later became an ardent admirer of the Baal 
2 CONC Shem Tov. Young Yechiel Michel received instruction from the Baal Shem Tov, becoming one of his most prominent disciples. After the Baal Shem Tov's passing, R' Yechiel Michel became a student of the Maggid of Mezritch.
