1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://akevoth.org/genealogy/ashkenazi/19975.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Baruch David Borchardt  Married ± 1798 Emden? to: Golda Levie Slesinger
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Franca Freidel Baruch Borchard Braslin, birth ± 1798 Amsterdam?, died 1851 Amsterdam, 'Franco/Sara-Shifra-Freidel bat Baruch Borchard/Braslin, wife of Abraham/Moshe-Abraham Joseph Susan'  Married 8 Sep 1819 Amsterdam, G.A.A. Am
2 CONC sterdam: Abraham Joseph Susan, 31 yrs.old, widower of Saartje[?] Abraham Brander, son of Joseph Abraham Susan & Betje Ruben Segal, and  Franke Borchardt, 21 yrs.old, daughter of Baruch David Borchardt & Golde Levie Slesinger.  Bro
2 CONC ther David Levie Borchardt, 23 yrs.old, is a witness.  (info courtesy of Dini Hansma, Utah, U.S.A.) to:  Abraham Joseph Juzpe de Swarte Susan, birth 1788 Amsterdam, 'Circumcisions and Births in Amsterdam 1697-1811, by Jits v.Strat
2 CONC en':  on 20 Nissan 5548 - circumcision of Abraham ben Juzpe ben Abraham Schuschan., son of Joseph Juzpe Abraham Susan and Basie Pes(che) Ruben Levie Event: event FROM 15 Mar 1821 TO 21 Jan 1830 Amsterdam death of children: G.A.A. 
2 CONC Amsterdam - death registrations:  on 15 Mar 1821 - stillborn son of Abraham Joseph Susan & Vrouwke David Barug Bosschart.  on 20 Feb 1827 - Baruch Abraham Susan, 8 days old, son of Abraham Joseph Susan & Franke Borcherdt.  Notifie
2 CONC r: Abraham Joseph Theeboom, 22 yrs.old, cousin[= uncle].  on 21 Jan 1830 - stillborn son of Abraham Joseph usan & Frauke Bochart.  Notifier: Mozes Abraham Brander, 45 yrs.old, [previous br.-in-law]  (info courtesy of Dini Hansma)
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Ester Baruch Borchardt, birth ± 1801 Emden  Married 29 Feb 1824 Hoorn, Abraham Juda Prins, 29 yrs.old, from Hoorn, son of Juda Aron Prins & Clara Marcus v.Host, and  Ester Borchardt, 22 yrs.old, from Emden, daughter of Baruch D
2 CONC avid Borchardt & Goltsi Levie.  (Genlias) to:  Abraham Juda Prins, birth ± 1794 Hoorn, son of Juda Aron Prins and Clara Marcus Meyer v.Host Event: event 6 Jun 1828 Amsterdam death of child: G.A.A. Amsterdam - death registrations: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin Abraham Prins, 6 months old, born on 19 Nov 1827 in Hoorn, son of Abraham Juda Prins & Esther Barug Borchart.  Notifier: Joseph Ruben, 38[?, = 24] yrs.old, cousin[= uncle's nephew]
