1 NOTE {geni:about_me} a short summary from Wikipedia :
2 CONT
2 CONT Mayer Amschel Rothschild: Born: 23 February 1744, Frankfurt am Main. Died: 19 September 1812 (aged 68), Frankfurt am Main, Grand Duchy of Frankfurt. Known for: Rothschild family.  Spouse:  Guttle Schnapper (m. 1770–1812).  Childre
2 CONC n: Schönche Jeannette Rothschild, Amschel Mayer von Rothschild, Salomon Mayer von Rothschild, Nathan Mayer Rothschild, Isabella Rothschild, Babette Rothschild, Carl Mayer von Rothschild, Julie Rothschild, Henriette Rothschild, Jam
2 CONC es Mayer de Rothschild.  Parents: 	Amschel Moses Rothschild, Schönche Rothschild
2 CONT
2 CONT "Mayer Amschel Rothschild (23 February 1744 – 19 September 1812) was a German banker. He was the founder of the Rothschild family international banking dynasty that became the most successful business family in history"
2 CONT
2 CONT ============================================================================
