1 CONT G4.1. R. Meir Wahl, A.B.D. of Brest-Litovsk, was known as Meir Shauls or MaHaRaSH. At the beginning of his career, he was elected A.B.D.  of Tiktin (Tykocin) where he was mentioned in the Memorial Book of the Departed. He was one 
1 CONC of the rabbis who helped establish the Council of the Land of  Lithuania which was similar to the Council of the Four Lands as the controlling body for the Jews of Lithuania, in 1623. At this time there was a court  composed of th
1 CONC e heads of the three communities of Brest, Grodno and Pinsk. The leadership of this council was for a long time occupied by the A.B.D. of Brest and thus R. Meir Katzenellenbogen became its head when he became A.B.D. Brest. Because
1 CONC  of his highly esteemed position among his people, the first and subsequent meetings were held in Brest. The records of this council  from its beginning in 1623 until 1764 are extant and were published in 1925 in Berlin by S. Dubn
1 CONC ow. In 1627 it is recorded that Meir had an ailment of  his hand so that a certain Issachar Ber signed for him, and in 1628 Meir could only manage to sign "Meir" himself. In the records of his time he is mentioned by the Tosfot Yo
1 CONC mtov in his Megillat Eiva, published, Breslau 1837, and the BaCH, (R. Joel Sirkes), wrote him a Responsum in his book Bayit Chadash. He was married twice. His first wife was Hinde, daughter of R. Phineas HaLevi Horowitz, who was t
1 CONC he brother-in-law of R. Moses Isserles, known as the ReMa. R. Phineas was the builder of the synagogue known as Pinkas Shul in Prague, where he settled after marrying. His second wife was Beila, who  died in Lublin.
0 @N6000000004339606174@ NOTE R' MEIR WAHL KATZENELLENBOGEN KNOWN AS THE MaHaRaSH (D. 1630) - HEINDA HOROWITZ (CRACOW). THEY MARRIED IN 1585. HEINDA WAS THE NIECE OF THE REMA (R' MOSHE ISSERLIS). HER FATHER WAS R' PINCHUS HOROWITZ (B. 1535 PRAGUE - D. 1618 CRA
1 CONC COW), AND HER MOTHER WAS MIRIAM BAILA ISSERLIS (D. 1617), THE SISTER OF THE REMA. MIRIAM BAILA ISSERLIS WAS THE DAUGHTER OF R' YISROEL ISSERLIN OF CRACOW. R' PINCHUS HOROWITZ WAS THE SON OF R' YISROEL HOROWITZ (1500-1572 PRAGUE), 
1 CONC AND ORTILLA STERN (B. 1507 PRAGUE - D. 1572 PRAGUE). R' YISROEL HOROWITZ WAS THE SON OF R' AARON MESHULIM ZALMAN HOROWITZ (1470-1545 PRAGUE), AND NECHAMA MUNK (1486-1536). R' ARON WAS THE SON OF R' ISAIAH HALEVI HOROWITZ (1465 HOR
1 CONC OWICE, CZECH-1517 PRAGUE), AND RIVCA YOMTOV HELLER (D. 1515 PRAGUE). THEY ARE THE PARENTS OF DEBORAH KATZENELLENBOGEN. R' MEIR WAHL WAS THE BROTHER OF JUDAH WAHL, WHO WAS THE GRANDFATHER OF DINA WAHL ( R' ABRAHAM YEHOSHUA HESCHEL'
1 CONC S WIFE).
