1 CONT
1 CONT Canandla (known as Mary Ann) Symons  married Solomon Gomes
1 CONT DaCosta7thDec 1815 and had 8 children.  As I have your address I am going to
1 CONT send
1 CONT you through the post all the information I have on this family.
1 CONT
