1 CONT greatgrandmother Frances to Isaac G.DaC who was a brother of Aaron G.daC
1 CONT Solomons's father.
1 CONT
1 CONT I will also send you a descendant chart of the Gomes DaCosta tree.
1 CONT
1 CONT How do you fit into this line? is it through a sibling of Mary?
